{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an underground sandbox adventure game. Here, you have to survive alone, fighting against bizarre forms of primitive and mutant organisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you need to delve into the maze like underground network, collect resources and technological blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build underground fortresses, plant crops, raise animals, and build ecosystems. piloting mecha for exploration, come and uncover the secrets beneath the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average update cycle of the game is two months, and this game has no DLC. All subsequent updates will be directly integrated into the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first two updates will add more animals, plants, and props, and later water sources or fishing systems will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sales reaching 1000 copies will update the power system, and up to 5000 copies will update the new map of underground rivers (new vehicles, new enemies, new plants).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874680?t=1753843107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874680/413305364ebd01f7471f8ca7fb6765cd4e68acce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753843107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874680/cd442507d6857dc7f1c97ab08f0d7768f4761edd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753843107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874680/cd442507d6857dc7f1c97ab08f0d7768f4761edd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753843107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The use of legal drugs in the game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an underground sandbox adventure game. Here, you have to survive alone, fighting against bizarre forms of primitive and mutant organisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you need to delve into the maze like underground network, collect resources and technological blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build underground fortresses, plant crops, raise animals, and build ecosystems. piloting mecha for exploration, come and uncover the secrets beneath the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average update cycle of the game is two months, and this game has no DLC. All subsequent updates will be directly integrated into the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first two updates will add more animals, plants, and props, and later water sources or fishing systems will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sales reaching 1000 copies will update the power system, and up to 5000 copies will update the new map of underground rivers (new vehicles, new enemies, new plants).</p>","developers":["\u5496\u5561\u4e0d\u52a0\u7cd6"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874680/d019e36370ceee86adaa184ba59e6c7ab71e3ab6/header.jpg?t=1753843107","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3874680/1432894699/d50319a3a4a9fbfbe42f4ce125a8da5bd404d0e0/1753264677/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753843105","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3874680/1432894699/d50319a3a4a9fbfbe42f4ce125a8da5bd404d0e0/1753264677/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753843105","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3874680/1432894699/d50319a3a4a9fbfbe42f4ce125a8da5bd404d0e0/1753264677/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753843105","id":257172755,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172755/movie480.mp4?t=1753843105","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172755/mov